2. The data (the *.rd5 routing tiles attached to the GitHub Releases)
=============================================================================

The .rd5 segment files published as release assets are NOT covered by the MIT
licence above and are not ours to license.

They are derived from OpenStreetMap data and are made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:

    (c) OpenStreetMap contributors
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

They are produced by BRouter (https://github.com/abrensch/brouter) and are
mirrored here from https://brouter.de/brouter/segments4/, which remains the
upstream and authoritative source.

Any product that displays or routes on this data must carry the OpenStreetMap
attribution, and any redistribution of the data or of a derived database is
subject to the share-alike terms of the ODbL.
